# A little story in Russian: мама, папа и кот
subtitle: "Read your first little Russian story, five sentences of words you already know and three new ones, then check what you understood."
tags: ["russian","reading","beginner story"]
teaches: ["vocabulary/present-tense-verbs","vocabulary/russian-nouns","grammar/noun-endings","reading/comprehension"]
thumb: "band \"You can already read this\" note \"кот = cat\" card charcoal"
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}

## A little story in Russian: мама, папа и кот
level: basic

    glossed s1 "Ма́ма и па́па в рестора́не." say_voice b gloss ["mum","and","dad","in","restaurant"] show_gloss after read_first true colors {"а$":"#b5482e"} x 430 y 615 font_size 44 hidden true
    glossed s2 "Ма́ма пьёт ко́фе, па́па пьёт чай." say_voice b gloss ["mum","drinks","coffee","dad","drinks","tea"] show_gloss after colors {"а$":"#b5482e"} x 430 y 515 font_size 44 hidden true
    glossed s3 "А кот? Он на столе́." say_voice b gloss ["and","cat","he","on","table"] show_gloss after x 430 y 415 font_size 44 hidden true
    glossed s4 "На столе́ молоко́." say_voice b gloss ["on","table","milk"] show_gloss after colors {"о$":"#8a5fa8"} x 430 y 315 font_size 44 hidden true
    glossed s5 "Кот то́же пьёт!" say_voice b gloss ["cat","too","drinks"] show_gloss after x 430 y 215 font_size 44 hidden true
    group story members ["s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"] hidden true
    icon open_cat size 200 set twemoji x 380 y 420 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat hidden true
    icon open_milk size 180 set twemoji x 620 y 420 or ["milk"] icon_look picture of "glass of milk" hidden true
    icon score_cat size 200 set twemoji x 400 y 420 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat hidden true
    icon score_milk size 180 set twemoji x 600 y 420 or ["milk"] icon_look picture of "glass of milk" hidden true

    card title "A little story"

A: Can you already read a Russian story?
    draw open_cat open_milk parallel true

    erase open_cat open_milk

A: Here are five short sentences, nearly all in words you know: read them first, and tap any word you're unsure of.
    draw s1 s2 s3 s4 s5

B: Ма́ма и па́па в рестора́не.
    highlight s1_words effect underline color #8f887c

B: Ма́ма пьёт ко́фе, па́па пьёт чай.
    highlight s2_words effect underline color #8f887c

B: А кот? Он на столе́.
    highlight s3_words effect underline color #8f887c

B: На столе́ молоко́.
    highlight s4_words effect underline color #8f887c

B: Кот то́же пьёт!
    highlight s5_words effect underline color #8f887c

    icon ic_rest size 100 set twemoji x 830 y 615 or ["fork and knife","restaurant"] icon_look picture of "fork and knife with plate"

A: The first sentence is all old words: mum and dad are in the restaurant, and, as in lesson one, Russian needs no word for are.
    highlight s1_words effect underline color #8f887c

    erase ic_rest

    icon ic_coffee size 75 set twemoji x 800 y 515 or ["coffee"] icon_look picture of "hot beverage"
    icon ic_tea size 75 set twemoji x 880 y 515 or ["tea","hot beverage"] icon_look picture of "teacup without handle"
    parallel true

A: Then a new word, пьёт, drinks: mum drinks coffee and dad drinks tea, the two drinks from the café.
    highlight s2_w_2 s2_w_5 effect underline color #8f887c

    erase ic_coffee ic_tea

    icon ic_cat size 100 set twemoji x 830 y 415 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat

B: And the cat? Он на столе́: he's on the table.
    highlight s3_words effect underline color #8f887c

A: Он, he, because кот ends in a consonant: a cat is a he, just as lesson two said.
    blocking false

    highlight s3_w_2 effect circle color #2f6b8f duration 2.2

    highlight s3_w_3 effect circle color #2f6b8f duration 3.5

A: And стол, the table, has gained an е after на, on: на столе́, just as ресторан became рестора́не after в.
    highlight s1_w_5 s3_w_5 s4_w_2 part е$ color #d0865f

    erase ic_cat

    icon ic_milk size 100 set twemoji x 830 y 315 or ["milk"] icon_look picture of "glass of milk"

B: So what's on the table? Молоко́: milk.
    highlight s4_words effect underline color #8f887c

A: Тоже means too, so the last sentence is the punchline: the cat drinks too, and we can guess what.
    highlight s5_words effect underline color #8f887c

    erase ic_milk

A: The colours are lesson two's endings: a red а on мама, a violet о on молоко, and a red а on папа, our one exception, who is still a he.
    blocking false

    highlight s1_w_1 s2_w_1 part а$ effect pulse color #b5482e duration 2.4

    highlight s4_w_3 part о$ effect pulse color #8a5fa8 duration 2.4

    highlight s1_w_3 s2_w_4 part а$ effect pulse color #b5482e duration 4

    hide story s1_g_1 s1_g_2 s1_g_3 s1_g_4 s1_g_5 s2_g_1 s2_g_2 s2_g_3 s2_g_4 s2_g_5 s2_g_6 s3_g_1 s3_g_2 s3_g_3 s3_g_4 s3_g_5 s4_g_1 s4_g_2 s4_g_3 s5_g_1 s5_g_2 s5_g_3

    quiz "Where are mum and dad? Pick one." reveal.text "в рестора́не" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        intro: Now four questions on the story, from memory.
        right: In a restaurant: ма́ма и па́па в рестора́не.
        wrong: Remember the first sentence: ма́ма и па́па в… what?
        * At home
        + In a restaurant
        * At the sea

    erase reveal_1_stamp

    quiz "True or false: па́па пьёт ко́фе." reveal.text "па́па пьёт чай" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: False: па́па пьёт чай; it's mum who drinks the coffee.
        wrong: Mum and dad drink different things: which one is the coffee?
        * True
        + False

    erase reveal_2_stamp

    ask "What is on the table? Type it in Russian." answer ["молоко"] translit true reveal.text "на столе́ молоко́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЧЫЬЯ
        right: Молоко́: на столе́ молоко́, there's milk on the table.
        wrong: It's white, and a cat likes it: six letters.

    erase reveal_3_stamp

    quiz "Who drinks the milk, do you think? Pick one." reveal.text "кот то́же пьёт" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: The cat: кот то́же пьёт, and the milk is right there on his table.
        wrong: Who is up on the table with the milk?
        * Ма́ма
        * Па́па
        + Кот

    erase reveal_4_stamp

    draw score_cat score_milk parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 3

    erase score_cat score_milk

    show story s1_g_1 s1_g_2 s1_g_3 s1_g_4 s1_g_5 s2_g_1 s2_g_2 s2_g_3 s2_g_4 s2_g_5 s2_g_6 s3_g_1 s3_g_2 s3_g_3 s3_g_4 s3_g_5 s4_g_1 s4_g_2 s4_g_3 s5_g_1 s5_g_2 s5_g_3

A: So you've read your first Russian story: old words did most of the work, three new ones filled the gaps, and the endings told you who was a he.
    blocking false

    highlight s2_w_2 s2_w_5 s5_w_3 s3_w_4 s4_w_1 s5_w_2 effect underline color #8f887c duration 4.2

    highlight s1_w_1 s1_w_3 s2_w_1 s2_w_4 part а$ effect pulse color #b5482e duration 1.6

    highlight s4_w_3 part о$ effect pulse color #8a5fa8 duration 1.6

B: And if the cat could talk, he'd say: молоко́, пожа́луйста! Пока́!
